name: div-mod-pow2
prereqs: [i32-provable — the widening refinement; without it the
  verdict only fires on literal-known non-negative dividends]
invariant: analysis-only; no structural mutation. A node is marked
  only when the divisor is an exact pow2 AND the dividend is provably
  non-negative — never a false positive (a false negative is fine).
scope: offered to c, go, rust, zig, estree (shift-capable); the glsl
  backend MUST ignore the verdict (ES 1.00 has no bitwise ops)
updates: none (first offer)
